      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans, sans-serif', fontSize: 14, color: '#684F48', letterSpacing: 3 }}>02 · INSIGHT</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'LXGW WenKai, serif', fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#33241F', marginTop: 10 }}>记忆正在流失，而回忆录停留在纸上</Text>
